ions as well as the media, arts; and economic and political systems. The courses explore how gender and sexuality intersect with race, culture, ethnicity, and social class in the interest of social justice","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":572.6666666666666,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":34.0,"r":293.0,"t":661.0},"charspan":[0,516],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/2","text":"The Gender and Sexuality Studies certificate program allows students to examine how gender and sexuality as social constructs shape individual lives, groups, institutions; and social structures_ Students will have the opportunity to examine individual development, couples; families; small groups, and organizations as well as the media, arts; and economic and political systems. The courses explore how gender and sexuality intersect with race, culture, ethnicity, and social class in the interest of social justice"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Certificates may be earned by regularly matriculated or extended learning students and denote successful completion of a prescribed program of study designed to:","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":532.0,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":34.666666666666664,"r":296.6666666666667,"t":564.3333333333334},"charspan":[0,161],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/3","text":"Certificates may be earned by regularly matriculated or extended learning students and denote successful completion of a prescribed program of study designed to:"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","enumerated":false,"label":"list_item","marker":"","orig":"impart specified professionallvocationallcareer competencies; or","parent":{"$ref":"#/groups/0"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":512.0,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":48.333333333333336,"r":279.0,"t":524.3333333333333},"charspan":[0,64],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/4","text":"impart specified professionallvocationallcareer competencies; or"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","enumerated